WEBVTT

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:21.090
Retracing a crime that's gone unsolved for nearly 30 years,

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:24.700
there's still more to come on "Mysterious Crime Files."

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.540
Now, K-kun, who was kidnapped back then,

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:30.950
was rescued after two months.

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:34.720
However, even though 28 years have passed,

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.340
the kidnapper of K-kun has never been found,

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:40.570
despite frantic police investigations.

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.860
The incident is still shrouded in mystery.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.980
No, I don't... I don't need it.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:52.190
Eat it.

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:54.080
Let me go.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:56.820
Let me go home!

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:00.160
Eat it.

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:02.750
No!

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:11.560
Young master.

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:15.720
Sorry, Chikage.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:17.550
It's the usual one.

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:21.340
If there's anything you need, please call me.

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:29.100
The next case on "Mysterious Crime Files" is—

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:40.630
I would be lying if I said I wasn't blessed.

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:44.620
You're late for work today, aren't you?

00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:50.330
I quit my job.

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:51.710
What?

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:54.100
I'm thinking about running a cake shop.

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:58.700
I see. That sounds nice.

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:00.950
I'd like to invest in that.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:05.140
Then I'll have to hire the best pâtissier.

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:10.690
Thank you... Father, Mother.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:16.770
Parents who aren't surprised, even if I suddenly resign from the biggest trading company.

00:02:17.290 --> 00:02:19.050
This life is fulfilling.

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:20.750
I too am fulfilled.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:50.150
But at the bottom, there's a dark void that can't be filled.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:57.900
Nightmares that trouble me occasionally.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.890
What happened back then?

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:30.700
Nice to meet you.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:35.460
I'm Ono Yuusuke.

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:39.090
Umm, Tachibana-san?

00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:44.420
What do you want to talk about, Ono?

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:46.640
Umm...

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:48.550
I...

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:57.160
love you!

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:59.880
Umm, did I do something wrong?

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.470
Well... no...

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:04.090
I-I was wondering whether my father forced you to come here.

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:05.420
Not at all.

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:08.160
I was really glad to be asked to work here,

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:13.520
since I was fired from my previous shop and was looking for somewhere to go.

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:19.410
Then, if you don't mind, would you taste this?

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:23.340
I know there isn't an employment test, but I made this anyway.

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:30.650
Why should I test a pâtissier who has worked at a three-star restaurant in Paris

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:34.680
and in famous pastry shops in Japan?

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:38.520
No, I think it would be best if you tasted it.

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:42.380
Choux à la crème, financier, shortcake.

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:45.530
I think these three will determine the level of the shop.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:51.640
I'm concerned if you'll like the butter, cream, and fruits I chose.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:52.490
Please.

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:55.450
By the way, do you...

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:56.400
Huh?

00:05:57.860 --> 00:05:59.440
He doesn't remember?

00:05:59.780 --> 00:06:03.400
Or am I mistaken, and he just has the same first and last names?

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:11.860
Anyway, I'd really like you to come work with me.

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:14.460
But, I have a question.

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:17.860
I know.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:23.650
You want to know why I've been fired from every shop within a year, right?

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:26.820
Well, yes...

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:33.590
Recently, two male employees at Gohachi competed over you and got into a violent altercation.

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:36.950
At Angelique, your deep relationship with the store manager turned bloody.

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:41.370
At Acatae, a male student who was working part-time fell in love with you and attempted suicide.

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:45.710
Roughly, that's what I've heard about your personal history.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:47.050
Sorry.

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:50.410
My past is embarrassing, and my only wish is that it would disappear.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:54.470
Well, that won't be a problem at our shop.

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:59.520
I'm thinking about running the shop initially with just you and me.

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:01.480
That's dangerous!

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.400
What do you mean?

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:09.070
Because, Tachibana-san, you're the type I like.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:19.500
He definitely is that Ono. He just doesn't recognize me.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.430
I really am a bother.

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:24.190
Leaving that aside,

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:31.590
are you the kind of gay who's so hungry for men that he'd pounce, even if I said I wasn't interested?

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:35.220
I-I'm not like that, but...

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:38.190
Did he remember?

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:42.110
Umm... Tachibana-san.

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.940
Can you promise not to laugh?

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.960
Nope. I might laugh, depending on the situation.

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:50.640
Then what should I do...

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:52.690
But I have to say it.

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:55.820
Won't you please listen, Tachibana-san?

00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:58.030
I'm...

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:02.080
...a devilish gay.

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:13.890
I-It's true.

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:17.420
Y-Your absent-minded face is devilish?

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:19.310
Your ape-like head is supposed to be devilish?

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.480
I am devilish.

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:27.700
But, I've never tempted people at my workplaces,

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:30.660
and I've never told anyone that I'm gay.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.420
But when they realized it, they were...

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.730
Fine, fine.

00:08:35.730 --> 00:08:37.660
It's definitely all right.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:42.230
I want you to know everything.

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:45.580
Tachibana-san, would you come with me now?

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:07.680
Then, shall we go?

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:09.270
Y-Yes.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:12.690
I-Is he that Ono?

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:47.890
Boss, did you call me?

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:50.770
Yeah, take a seat.

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:52.450
I bought you some cake.

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:54.590
Oh, thank you, boss!

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.110
So...

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:04.440
You really do have a detached retina.

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:11.080
I knew it. It felt like it during the exam.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:17.350
Then, I have to quit boxing.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:20.720
I don't want to quit.

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.680
I don't want to quit...

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:32.860
Yummy...

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:36.820
Yeah. From now on, you can eat as much as you want.

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:40.580
This tastes good, really good.

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:45.420
But, I don't want to quit boxing.

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:48.910
Boss, I don't want to quit!

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.630
I don't want to quit!

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:55.130
You have to, Eiji.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:59.480
If you take boxing away from me, what will I have left?!

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:02.370
Everyone says that.

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:09.740
But, even after saying that, they all lead good lives.

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:15.980
Well, I have powerful connections.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.370
Ramen shop, or ramen shop...

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:20.190
or ramen shop.

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:26.660
Boss, your only connections are ramen shops.

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:40.970
Ono-san, isn't this the famous...

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:41.520
Shinjuku ni-chome is a major center for gay nightlife in Tokyo.

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:43.750
It's Shinjuku ni-chome.
Shinjuku ni-chome is a major center for gay nightlife in Tokyo.

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:46.490
That's my favorite bar right there.
Shinjuku ni-chome is a major center for gay nightlife in Tokyo.

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:46.600
Shinjuku ni-chome is a major center for gay nightlife in Tokyo.

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:08.660
Then, I looked closer, and it was bent.

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:13.500
Let's go.

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:17.310
Welcome.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.320
Good evening.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.150
Oh, Yu-chan. Long time, no see.

00:12:25.150 --> 00:12:26.560
Sorry for the long absence.

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:29.010
Eh? Is this Yu-chan?

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:32.580
Umm, I've only come here recently...

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:34.500
I'm Atsushi.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:35.710
Pleased to meet you.

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:38.900
Umm... Can I call you Akkun?

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:39.480
Yes.

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:42.190
Nice to meet you. You're cute.

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:49.200
He's straight.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.160
Don't make advances to him, master.

00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:53.040
Oh, is he now?

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:56.210
I'm Toda, the master of this bar. Nice to meet you.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.970
N-Nice to meet you.

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:01.210
Yu-chan! You were gone a long time.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:02.090
What were you doing?

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.670
I didn't have a job, and I was broke.

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:09.410
I assume you made some straight guy crazy for you and got fired.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:11.350
Well, something like that.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:13.270
Why did you tempt a straight guy?

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:15.530
I didn't tempt him.

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:18.450
I just thought he was cute.

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:19.910
See what I mean?

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:25.120
Any man Yu-chan thinks is cute won't be able to resist him.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:35.460
Yu-chan is famous as a devilish gay.

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.770
Devilish...

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:50.050
Were you surprised?

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:51.480
It surprised me.

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:58.270
When I was a senior in high school, a boy I loved rejected me completely.

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:00.940
That's it... Did he finally remember?

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:04.440
He said I was disgusting and should go die.

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:05.400
Die!

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:08.400
It was too shocking.

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:11.640
I don't remember his name and face, but...

00:14:13.760 --> 00:14:16.330
I thought of killing myself.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:24.370
But then, I thought I should do what I want before I die.

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:26.660
And I came straight to ni-chome.

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:29.390
The first bar I entered was this one.

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:35.180
Yu-chan went directly to a hotel with a cute boy who met his eyes.

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:38.770
That boy was crazy about Yu-chan,

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:40.350
and he was quite a nuisance.

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:47.020
Since then, any man Yu-chan likes,

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:51.340
whether gay or straight, goes crazy about him.

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:55.870
So, that's the story.

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:10.490
Geez, Yu-chan is quite the quick worker.

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:13.890
What?

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:30.900
Now you know why I don't last long at any job.

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.360
Well, sort of.

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:40.170
I was pleased when I heard that I would be the only employee at Antique...

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:43.460
But...

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.670
Wh-What?

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:54.140
Sorry, but I can't work at Antique.

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:55.920
Wh-Wh-Wh-Why?!

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:58.970
Because you're just my type.

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:00.600
Too close. Too close. Too close!

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:01.750
Don't be shy.

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:05.950
Someday you'll definitely fall in love with me.

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:08.690
N-N-N-No, I won't.

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:09.900
No, you will.

00:16:10.560 --> 00:16:13.990
If it's going to end up like that anyway, let's do it now.

00:16:15.670 --> 00:16:18.290
It's no use pretending to be scared.

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:23.410
You're already thinking about giving me a tight hug.

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:27.690
How about it, Tachibana-san?

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:29.300
S-Stop!

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:31.830
Ono!

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:32.680
Yes?

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:35.930
It's me, Tachibana.

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:40.260
The boy who rejected you during senior year!

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:41.810
Tachibana from 3-E.

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:53.630
Do you remember?

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:56.260
I'm the Tachibana who told you to die.

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:58.030
You're doing this on purpose, right?

00:16:58.270 --> 00:16:59.510
No.

00:16:59.510 --> 00:17:02.450
I see! You are...

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.200
It's nostalgic.

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:07.040
Liar! You're doing this to annoy me.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:08.950
I was really scared.

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:10.750
Am I that scary?

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:15.330
No, it really doesn't work.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:18.540
Your magic doesn't work on me!

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.360
Forget about it.

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:26.270
Oh, if that's the case, you should've told me sooner.

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:29.250
I guess you won't fall into my hands,

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:32.030
because you're the only one who ever rejected me.

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:34.430
Anyway, this is fine.

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:36.820
I won't have to lose my job.

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:38.990
Are you sure?

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:43.540
You'll be working under someone who said such cruel things to you in the past.

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:46.060
It's all right.

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:51.750
If you hadn't said them, I couldn't live so freely now.

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:55.310
So it's really okay.

00:17:55.970 --> 00:18:00.850
As proof, I couldn't remember you until you spoke.

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:01.790
But...

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:08.050
It's a pleasure, Tachibana.

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:09.850
Let's make this shop a great one.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:14.650
I'm counting on you.

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:21.620
And how long are you gonna hold my hand?!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.870
Let go!

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:27.120
So you're really not gonna fall in love with me.

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:30.330
Why are you the only one who's immune?

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:31.770
It's a mystery.

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:34.120
Who knows? Now, let's go back.

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:47.140
Y-Yu-chan, if it's okay with you, why don't we have another drink?

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:49.880
Akkun, were you waiting for me?

00:18:52.390 --> 00:18:53.580
So, shall we go?

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:54.640
Yes.

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:56.190
Well, see you later.

00:18:56.770 --> 00:18:58.490
Y-Yeah.

00:19:04.460 --> 00:19:08.210
But, it's quite amazing that he really forgot about me.

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:11.580
He must've been really shocked.

00:19:31.010 --> 00:19:33.630
What is it? Spill it.

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:36.230
I love you.

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:39.280
I'm sorry!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:42.520
I know that I'm being annoying.

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:48.410
I know you're quite popular among the girls, and you're a totally normal guy...

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:54.550
but I wanted to tell you my feelings before I graduated from high school.

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:56.540
That's all I wanted to say.

00:19:56.930 --> 00:20:01.620
So... So... So, that's really it. I'm...

00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:02.630
Wait, Ono!

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:07.950
Are you satisfied just confessing that you love me?

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:13.520
You love me, right?

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:19.190
You want to sleep with me, right?

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:22.860
Don't you feel disgusted?

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:26.870
Disgusted? Of course I do!

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:28.670
It makes me want to puke!

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:29.580
Die, you homo!

00:20:37.140 --> 00:20:38.330
Yu-chan.

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:40.760
Sorry.
